# Retired CodeAtelier configuration template; do not copy this file to .env.
# 1. Product startup and Vite no longer load dotenv or use its values as overrides.
# 2. Start the application and use the settings UI; settings.json lives in the host data directory.
# 3. Existing installations must explicitly preflight and migrate their old configuration.
# 4. Model/MCP credentials use a private JSON file, not an encrypted vault; never commit real settings.
# See docs/settings-system.md for --data-dir, migration, restart rules and credential boundaries.
# This retained notice contains no environment assignments or working credentials.
